theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 30
text = " Enemies are in a magic circle.
You can only attack them,
using A, B, C, D options buttons.

Getting inside this circle 
depletes your stamina, so be
careful.

They have an HP you need
to deplete and can shoot you
magical bullets to hurt you."

