theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 30
text = "You have to pick the correct choice of
Japanese meaning in English.

This is is meant to grind your passive
Vocabulary, nothing else.

A good choice can hurt the enemy HP.
A bad choice has no effect except
increasing your mistake counter.

The mistake counter bar only is saved once the number of 
words reviewed is bigger than your last record of the same number."

